 and Karen Vardanyan both receiving yellow cards. Despite late pressure and the introduction of Gulzhigit Alykulov for the visitors, SC Braga remained composed. The final whistle at 90+3' confirmed a professional performance and a hard-earned result for the Portuguese outfit."
